        "eyebrow": "OUR STORY",
        "heading_plain": "Crafted with",
        "heading_italic": "Intention",
        "body_text_1": "<p>Born in San Francisco, Hijab Elegance was founded on a simple belief: that modest fashion deserves the same level of quality, design, and attention to detail as any luxury brand.</p>",
